    m_Localized: Free play. Click Reel while the marker is in green. Land 3 of 5
      attempts to earn 3 Coins, once per town day. No entry fee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 838651433353218
    m_Localized: Reel!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 838651433353219
    m_Localized: Well fished! Daily reward saved if not already claimed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 838651433353220
    m_Localized: Good practice. Start another round from the conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839155051823104
    m_Localized: "HARBOR BULLETIN \u2014 Authored report\nHome and Town harbors are
      open. Current skies are clear; dynamic weather arrives in the next milestone.
      Visit rocky shores for different fish. Keep displayed specimens in their tanks
      until you choose to remove them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842157263323136
    m_Localized: "Island cookie \xB7 five-minute reel assistance"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842157607256064
    m_Localized: "Bait dough \xB7 five-minute larger-catch luck"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842157921828864
    m_Localized: Natural river sand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842158261567488
    m_Localized: Decorative kelp
